WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.067 --> 00:00:03.503 line:0%
I think a millennia from now,

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:04.937 line:0%
people are gonna look back
and say,

00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:06.038
<i>"Wow, the late 20th century</i>

00:00:06.205 --> 00:00:08.475
<i> was really a great time
to be alive on this planet."</i>

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:17.851
Y2K. What does it mean?

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:20.052
SPEAKER:<i> Using two digits
 rather than four</i>

00:00:20.119 --> 00:00:20.987
<i>made good economic sense.</i>

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:24.157
SPEAKER 2:<i> But when workers
advance clocks to the year 2000?</i>

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:25.458
SPEAKER 3:
<i>The world could meltdown.</i>

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:28.327
Our systems are broken.

00:00:28.394 --> 00:00:30.329
We've got a problem
with a couple of digits.

00:00:31.063 --> 00:00:32.131
SPEAKER 4:
<i> This has to be solved.</i>

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:34.167
SPEAKER 5:<i> This now looks
 like a black hole.</i>

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:37.970
<i>The closer you get to it,
 the more it speeds up.</i>

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:40.440
SPEAKER 6:<i> Personal computers
 are the least of it.</i>

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:43.509
SPEAKER 7:<i> It's the economies
 of the countries
 that are interconnected.</i>

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:47.146
This is clearly one of the most
complex challenges in history.

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:49.916
I pray that people don't panic.

00:00:52.518 --> 00:00:54.454
I feel like our days
could be numbered.

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:58.958
SPEAKER 8:<i> It's a paranoid
 and pathological time.</i>

00:00:59.024 --> 00:01:00.426
Lots of weird stuff happens.

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.194
SPEAKER 9:
<i> There are people who are</i>

00:01:02.261 --> 00:01:05.098
<i> deliberately predicting
 the very worst.</i>

00:01:05.164 --> 00:01:06.398
NEWS ANCHOR:
<i> Militia groups worry</i>

00:01:06.465 --> 00:01:09.035
<i> that the US government
 could grab more power.</i>

00:01:09.101 --> 00:01:10.169
CROWD:<i> Five...</i>

00:01:10.269 --> 00:01:11.904
SPEAKER 10:<i> First, the lights
 will go out in Asia.</i>

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:14.107
-CROWD:<i> Four...</i>
-I'm concerned about terrorism.

00:01:15.074 --> 00:01:17.010
-CROWD:<i> Three...</i>
-Chaos and confusion.

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:19.011
-CROWD:<i> Two...</i>
-Everything's gonna collapse.

00:01:19.078 --> 00:01:20.112
CROWD:<i> One...</i>

00:01:20.179 --> 00:01:21.814
There is nothing
I want more right now...

00:01:22.481 --> 00:01:25.151
<i>than for the entire world
 to be slowed.</i>

